  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring and Evaluation Capacity Building in Anglophone Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will improve monitoring and evaluation frameworks, capacity, and use in supported developing countries in the Anglophone African region. In doing so, the project will seek to build partnerships with existing Evaluation Capacity Development (ECD) providers to generate synergies.This project aims to contribute to the higher-level development objective of the Global Evaluation Initiative (GEI), namely, to improve monitoring and evaluation frameworks, capacity, and use in supported Anglophone African countries for improved evidence-informed policy making.</narrative>
  </description>
